4. RAG 
    Ingestion
        > Load text (TextLoader)
        > split text
        > embed text
        > store files in vector store
    Retrieval 
        > Retrieval object
        > Prompt Template
        Implementaion 1: Retrieval without LCEL
            > invoke retriever with query
            > format the docs by joining all the retrieved documents into a single string
            > format prompt Template with the context (formatted doc from prev step) and query 
            > invoke llm with formated Template as message

            return the response
        Implementaion 2: With LCEL
            > (gets querry as input from the call)
            > create a chain with 
                o Create a sub chain
                    Querry | retriever | format docs 
                    => this gives context which is passed through out the main chain
                o prompt Template
                o llm
                o StrOutputParser
            > return chain

    Invoking
        1. Invoke llm directly with querry
        2. Invoke llm with Implementaion 1 with querry
        3. Invoke llm with Implementaion 2 with querry

